# Version-control policy for the FYP repository.
#
# TRACKED (deliberately): the two deliverables and their Markdown sources, the
# user's own originals, proposal\sections\, proposal\i18n\zh-HK\, proposal\research\,
# proposal\integration\ (history, including the backup-* folders), the toolchain in
# proposal\tools\md2docx\, and the evidence\ tree.
#
# NOT TRACKED, and the reason for each.

# The superseded ~286,932-word generation. agent.md §9: "Do not submit or present
# as the project." Kept on disk as reference; excluded here so that no submission
# bundle built from Git can contain it by accident.
legacy/

# Build products and scratch, per agent.md §9 ("Sources vs generated"). The sources
# are proposal\i18n\zh-HK\*.md, which stay tracked; these outputs are regenerable.
proposal/tools/i18n-w6-auto/out/
proposal/tools/i18n-w6-auto/zh/
proposal/tools/i18n-p08/out/
proposal/tools/i18n-p08/zh/
proposal/tools/md2docx/stress/

# One-line scratch files; agent.md §9 says "Ignore".
proposal/z-scratch-audit/

# Editor and OS noise.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
